==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|bouldly}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|boldely}}, {{m|enm|boldeliche}}, {{m|enm|baldeliche}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bealdlīċe|t=boldly, earnestly}}, equivalent to {{af|en|bold|-ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈboʊldli/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈbəʊldli/|[ˈbɒʊldli]}}
* {{hyph|en|bold|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|er|more}}

# In a [[bold]] manner; with [[confidence]].
#: ''To '''boldly''' go where no man has gone before.''

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|boldly go where no man has gone before}}

